            "body": "<p>Not usually the reason people buy the first pair. Often the reason they come back for a second.</p>"
          }
        },
        "e3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Everywhere that isn’t a mosque",
            "body": "<p>Airports, building sites, university prayer rooms, car parks in February. Wudu rarely happens somewhere designed for it.</p>"
          }
